and i doubt i would have financed that even if i'd had the money i gave him everything i had which was 35 dollars and i said listen i can give you 20 bucks but then he said listen if i have to tell my story to like five more people to get the money i need i'll be here all day i don't want to be in philadelphia tonight with no place to go i think all right that sounds logical so i went to to an ATM machine, took out a hundred and gave it to him.

